rt Suns Band"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"A proposito di donne","overview":"Storia dell'amicizia che lega tre donne apparentemente diverse tra loro, ma tutte reduci da insoddisfacenti esperienze domestiche: una jazz-woman omosessuale e provocatoria, una borghese \"all american\" malata di Aids e una giovane irriverente e inarrestabile.","tagline":"Il film che celebre l'arte del sopravvivere, il dono del sorriso e il miracolo dell'amicizia."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After breaking up with her girlfriend, a nightclub singer, Jane, answers a personal ad from Robin, a real estate agent with AIDS, seeking a cross-country travel partner. On their journey from New York City to Los Angeles, the two stop by Pittsburgh to pick up Jane's friend Holly, who is trying to escape an abusive relationship. With three distinct personalities, the women must overcome their differences to help one another.","tagline":"A motion picture that celebrates the art of survival, the gift of laughter and the miracle of friendship."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1qMonB3rlnkjbQZgdQOtOAt68RO.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qMonB3rlnkjbQZgdQOtOAt68RO.png","language":"it","width":4209,"height":1259},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bt9cecYhOCwPNEvklW2aLg8mEP.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bt9cecYhOCwPNEvklW2aLg8mEP.png","language":"en","width":4318,"height":430},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/98n8D4D7uObBTgalUwiOhO4sl9c.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/98n8D4D7uObBTgalUwiOhO4sl9c.png","language":"en","width":784,"height":75},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3WgcxPahDF2hGtOQ84alU7gJ3IZ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3WgcxPahDF2hGtOQ84alU7gJ3IZ.png","language":"en","width":778,"height":59},{"type":"logo","url":"https